<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Bind this to your shoot key! 
It will reduce your secondary smg recoil drasticly to the point where you only have side recoil a little bit.
Resolution recomended is 1920x1080 (it worked for me on lower resolution scales)
Sensitivity:10 in game controls and 600dpi for mouse
If its a big if you press in game to  shoot and it doesnt shoot the gun and activates the macro download the apps drivers!


</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 8 ms
Delay 16 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 16 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>